### Architecture
- No auth (manager + candidate pages fully public)
- SQLite via better-sqlite3 (local only, not prod-ready)
- opencode.ai / deepseek-v4-flash for caller simulation + evaluation + analysis
- Pack-driven deterministic scoring (per-pack scoringCriteria + diagnosticChecklist)
- session_events as canonical event stream (unified for all assignment types)
- Service desk shell shared across all 3 assignment types (capability-gated)
- Two-column PSA-style ticket workspace (left: metadata + triage, right: description + notes)
- Taxonomy XLSX upload → DB → triage dropdowns
- Auto-analysis on ticket submission (3-stage pipeline)

