## Data Flow

```
Manager creates assessment (POST /api/mvp/assessments)
  → stores assessment_type + assessment_pack_id + manager standards snapshot
  → creates sim_session for training_drill

Candidate opens token (GET /api/mvp/assessment/[token])
  → returns assessment data, pack info, sim state, capabilities
  → if completed: also returns analysis results

Candidate works ticket
  → sim actions: POST /sim/action → state machine → sim_events + session_events
  → voice: POST /message → AI customer → transcript in session_events
  → notes: POST /event → session_events
  → triage: POST /event → session_events (10+ event types)

Candidate submits ticket (POST /ticket)
  → stores ticket in DB
  → completes sim session
  → triggers runBaseCallumAnalysis() (3-stage)
  → returns { status, analysis, candidate_analysis }

Candidate sees results (AssessmentResults.tsx)
  → score, readiness label, diagnostic checklist, strengths, improvements
  → reload persists via GET route returning candidate_analysis
```

