## Key Architecture Decisions

| Decision | Current |
|---|---|
| Database | SQLite (better-sqlite3) |
| Auth | None (public) |
| AI provider | opencode.ai (deepseek-v4-flash) |
| Sim engine | Pack-driven (SimPack + stateMachine) |
| Scoring | Deterministic (per-pack + analysis fail gates) |
| Events | session_events (canonical, unified) |
| Candidate UI | ServiceDeskSimulatorShell (shared across assignment types) |
| Taxonomy | XLSX upload → taxonomy_items DB → triage dropdowns |

